* Sun Oct 18 2026 Steven Pritchard <steve@sicura.us> - 0.1.0
- Initial release
- Installs the `ufw` package; everything else is managed only when its
  parameter is set
- Manages ufw's enabled state, default policies, logging level, IPv6 support
  and service
- Manages ufw rules with `ufw::rules_entries` and the new `ufw_rule` type;
  every rule must set `action`
- Removes conflicting packages such as `iptables-persistent` when asked to,
  with `ufw::conflicting_packages_entries`
- Fails compilation when enabling ufw, or setting a denying incoming policy,
  would block incoming SSH, unless `ufw::allow_lockout` is set
